      "comment": "WHISKY ADDICTION (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (20.50) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Should be very hard to beat this time. SECRET ADVICE (2) is mixing form lately, finishing out of the placings last time at this track but was a Maiden winner two back at this track. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. LILLYVALE LAD (6) missed the frame last time when sixth (30.54) at Dubbo but prior to that had four placings in a row. The form out of his last race has been franked. In the mix. ROBELL POLLY (3) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
